  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "A"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Number of rectangles possible is<br /><br />= (Number of ways to choose a horizontal side of odd length).(Number of ways to choose&nbsp;a vertical side of odd&nbsp;length)<br /><br /><math> <mrow> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mn>1</mn> <mo>+</mo> <mn>3</mn> <mo>+</mo> <mn>5</mn> <mo>+</mo> <mtext>.....</mtext> <mo>+</mo> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mn>2</mn> <mtext>m</mtext> <mo>-</mo> <mn>1</mn> </mrow> </mfenced> </mrow> </mfenced> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mn>1</mn> <mo>+</mo> <mn>3</mn> <mo>+</mo> <mn>5</mn> <mo>+</mo> <mtext>.....</mtext> <mo>+</mo> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mn>2</mn> <mi>n</mi> <mo>-</mo> <mn>1</mn> </mrow> </mfenced> </mrow> </mfenced> <mo>=</mo> <msup> <mtext>m</mtext> <mn>2</mn> </msup> <msup> <mi>n</mi> <mn>2</mn> </msup> </mrow> </math></p>"
